{"3513030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Forks and Daggers", "steam_appid": 3513030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forks &amp; Daggers</strong> is a <strong>Chaotic</strong> <strong>Medieval Social Deduction Game</strong> where players <strong>complete</strong> <strong>tasks</strong> while hidden <strong>Assassins</strong> secretly <strong>kill others</strong>, and <strong>sabotage the manor</strong>. Find the traitor or choose to be a traitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the environment as a weapon itself.</strong> Grab and throw anything you find, equip a frying pan or a stick to defend yourself against a chaotic situation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/b927dfed65cfdf6033807fed79f4b62e.poster.avif?t=1777125645\" width=770 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/b927dfed65cfdf6033807fed79f4b62e.webm?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/b927dfed65cfdf6033807fed79f4b62e.mp4?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're chosen to be an <strong>Assassin (Daggers)</strong>, you can <strong>sneak</strong> around, <strong>fake tasks</strong>,  and <strong>Eliminate servants</strong>, all without getting caught. <strong>And need a partner in crime, invite anyone to your Dagger Club.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/d4bd05adce47990b77f52621b4b40725.poster.avif?t=1777125645\" width=770 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/d4bd05adce47990b77f52621b4b40725.webm?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/d4bd05adce47990b77f52621b4b40725.mp4?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Out? No problem, manor is not done with you yet. Respawn as a <strong>Cat</strong> or <strong>Rat</strong> to mess around or help the others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/5d21216892956b39c102c4d4d266e4c3.poster.avif?t=1777125645\" width=770 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/5d21216892956b39c102c4d4d266e4c3.webm?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/5d21216892956b39c102c4d4d266e4c3.mp4?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>Quests</strong> to win, <strong>earn new skills</strong>, and <strong>improve yourself</strong> to be stronger and clever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/dda7f2bf1852fb6666144dbfcd8551d0.poster.avif?t=1777125645\" width=770 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/dda7f2bf1852fb6666144dbfcd8551d0.webm?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/dda7f2bf1852fb6666144dbfcd8551d0.mp4?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger traps to eliminate, use the environment as a support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/5b07fe27f90c0205ad1047b69888e30c.poster.avif?t=1777125645\" width=770 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/5b07fe27f90c0205ad1047b69888e30c.webm?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/5b07fe27f90c0205ad1047b69888e30c.mp4?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Dagger, ignite the fireplace and sabotage the Manor to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/d05622a69632002485f8c383f9bdd87a.poster.avif?t=1777125645\" width=770 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/d05622a69632002485f8c383f9bdd87a.webm?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/d05622a69632002485f8c383f9bdd87a.mp4?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve or Sabotage</strong> – Be a loyal servant or a secret assassin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Tasks</strong> – Clean, cook, gather, and repair the manor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Convert Others</strong> – Drop a red scroll to recruit new assassins mid-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Afterlife Roles</strong> – Play as a rat or cat after death to keep influencing the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Traps</strong> - Learn and use the traps in the manor to eliminate in a creative way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everyhing can be a Weapon </strong>– Grab anything throw it to others or use as a weapon to defend yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3–10 Player Online Party Game</strong> – Fun, chaos, and betrayal with friends or strangers.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forks &amp; Daggers</strong> is a <strong>Chaotic</strong> <strong>Medieval Social Deduction Game</strong> where players <strong>complete</strong> <strong>tasks</strong> while hidden <strong>Assassins</strong> secretly <strong>kill others</strong>, and <strong>sabotage the manor</strong>. Find the traitor or choose to be a traitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the environment as a weapon itself.</strong> Grab and throw anything you find, equip a frying pan or a stick to defend yourself against a chaotic situation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/b927dfed65cfdf6033807fed79f4b62e.poster.avif?t=1777125645\" width=770 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/b927dfed65cfdf6033807fed79f4b62e.webm?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/b927dfed65cfdf6033807fed79f4b62e.mp4?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're chosen to be an <strong>Assassin (Daggers)</strong>, you can <strong>sneak</strong> around, <strong>fake tasks</strong>,  and <strong>Eliminate servants</strong>, all without getting caught. <strong>And need a partner in crime, invite anyone to your Dagger Club.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/d4bd05adce47990b77f52621b4b40725.poster.avif?t=1777125645\" width=770 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/d4bd05adce47990b77f52621b4b40725.webm?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/d4bd05adce47990b77f52621b4b40725.mp4?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Out? No problem, manor is not done with you yet. Respawn as a <strong>Cat</strong> or <strong>Rat</strong> to mess around or help the others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/5d21216892956b39c102c4d4d266e4c3.poster.avif?t=1777125645\" width=770 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/5d21216892956b39c102c4d4d266e4c3.webm?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/5d21216892956b39c102c4d4d266e4c3.mp4?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>Quests</strong> to win, <strong>earn new skills</strong>, and <strong>improve yourself</strong> to be stronger and clever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/dda7f2bf1852fb6666144dbfcd8551d0.poster.avif?t=1777125645\" width=770 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/dda7f2bf1852fb6666144dbfcd8551d0.webm?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/dda7f2bf1852fb6666144dbfcd8551d0.mp4?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger traps to eliminate, use the environment as a support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/5b07fe27f90c0205ad1047b69888e30c.poster.avif?t=1777125645\" width=770 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/5b07fe27f90c0205ad1047b69888e30c.webm?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/5b07fe27f90c0205ad1047b69888e30c.mp4?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Dagger, ignite the fireplace and sabotage the Manor to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/d05622a69632002485f8c383f9bdd87a.poster.avif?t=1777125645\" width=770 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/d05622a69632002485f8c383f9bdd87a.webm?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/d05622a69632002485f8c383f9bdd87a.mp4?t=1777125645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve or Sabotage</strong> – Be a loyal servant or a secret assassin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Tasks</strong> – Clean, cook, gather, and repair the manor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Convert Others</strong> – Drop a red scroll to recruit new assassins mid-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Afterlife Roles</strong> – Play as a rat or cat after death to keep influencing the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Traps</strong> - Learn and use the traps in the manor to eliminate in a creative way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everyhing can be a Weapon </strong>– Grab anything throw it to others or use as a weapon to defend yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3–10 Player Online Party Game</strong> – Fun, chaos, and betrayal with friends or strangers.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A Chaotic Medieval Social Deduction Party Game for 3–10 Players. Find the traitor or become a traitor. Use Manor as a weapon itself; throw, hit, arm trap. Convert to a Dagger to hide and eliminate.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/e0494ea27fc63422d2bdd12501c7f4ea6a8b05e8/header.jpg?t=1777125645", "capsule_image": "https://s